# The challenge notebooks are kept as provenance, not as the work.
#
# docs/provenance.md explains what they are: the original Digital Product School
# submission, preserved unmodified so the rebuilt model can be compared against
# what was first handed in. They are 255 KB of notebook JSON against 71 KB of
# Python, so GitHub reported this as a Jupyter Notebook repository and anyone
# reading the language bar was told the opposite of what the repository is.
#
# linguist-documentation excludes them from the language statistics while leaving
# them in the tree, browsable and diffable, which is the point of keeping them.
notebooks/** linguist-documentation
